<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #111827;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 24px;
        }
        .reminder {
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin: 16px 0;
            background-color: #fafafa;
        }
        .reminder p {
            margin: 6px 0;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #1d4ed8;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6b7280;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding: 16px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Attendance Reminder</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{employeeName}},</p>

            <div class="reminder">
                <p><strong>Attendance not marked</strong></p>
                <p>As of {{currentTime}}, your attendance for today is still pending.</p>
            </div>

            <p>Please mark your attendance at your earliest convenience to keep records accurate.</p>

            <p>
                <a href="{{attendanceLink}}" class="button">Mark Attendance</a>
            </p>

            <p>If you have already completed this action, you may safely ignore this message.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated notification. Please do not reply.</p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Leave Management System</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
